      "id": "tuyOE",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced></math>",
